  "summary": "Comscore, Inc. (Nasdaq: SCOR), a trusted partner for planning, transacting and evaluating media, today announced that it plans to hold a conference call to discuss its financial results for the second quarter ended June 30, 2026, on Wednesday, August 12th at 5:00 p.m. ET.",
